  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to our stunning Beach Blessing! This brand new construction offers the perfect blend of modern elegance and coastal charm. With three spacious bedrooms, two and a half bathrooms, and a range of desirable amenities, this is the ultimate getaway for your beach vacation.<br><br>Step inside and be greeted by an inviting and open living space, filled with natural light and tastefully decorated. The living area features comfortable seating and a large flat-screen TV, perfect for relaxing after a day of sun-soaked adventures. The adjacent dining area provides ample space for enjoying meals together with your loved ones.<br>Prepare delicious meals in the fully equipped kitchen, complete with top-of-the-line appliances, including a convenient gas stove. Whether you're a culinary enthusiast or just enjoy whipping up quick snacks, this kitchen has everything you need to satisfy your appetite.<br><br>The three bedrooms are thoughtfully designed to provide a restful retreat for everyone. Each room boasts comfortable beds, plush bedding, and ample storage space for your belongings. The bathrooms are modern and well-appointed, featuring sleek fixtures and a combination of showers and bathtubs. You'll find all the necessary amenities and fresh towels to make your stay comfortable and convenient. Indulge in the ultimate luxury in the master bathroom, which features a rain shower to enhance your relaxation and rejuvenation. Step into the spacious shower enclosure and let the gentle cascade of water wash away your cares, creating a tranquil spa-like experience. The rain shower adds an extra touch of opulence to the master bathroom, providing a soothing and invigorating way to start or end your day. Immerse yourself in the calming sensation of the rain-like droplets, allowing the stress to melt away as you enjoy this luxurious amenity.<br><br>One of the highlights of this vacation rental is the grill, perfect for hosting barbecue nights with family and friends. Whether you're grilling up the catch of the day or sizzling some juicy steaks, the outdoor grilling area provides a delightful space for al fresco dining. In addition to the beach being close by, the community offers a sparkling pool for you to cool off and relax under the warm sun. Lounge by the poolside with a refreshing drink in hand or take a refreshing dip to escape the heat.<br><br>​​​​​​​With its prime location by the beach, stunning new construction, a grill for outdoor cooking, access to a community pool, and pet-friendly policies, this vacation rental is the ultimate destination for your beach getaway. Book now and create unforgettable memories in this coastal paradise!<br><br>1 dog allowed <25 lbs with extra pet fee<br><br>Security systems/cameras:<br><br>For the security of our guests and the safety of our home, we have external security cameras.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
